- **State:** received → accepted (durable inbox) → responded (durable outbox) → sent. There are three named interruption points, I1–I3. Invocation is at-least-once and every run is logged. The same ID with different bytes is rejected.
- **Budgets, stated separately:** the whole test, each contract attempt, the start rate, CPU/memory, message size (16 KiB), turns (0–7) and delivery attempts (30).
